cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use loqculate in your work, please cite it as below. Also cite the original Pino 2020 method paper."
title: "loqculate: Limit of Detection and Quantitation calculator for mass-spectrometry calibration curves"
version: 0.4.1
date-released: 2026-09-11
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/eneskemalergin/loqculate"
authors:
  - family-names: Ergin
    given-names: Enes Kemal
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9810-7399"
keywords:
  - proteomics
  - mass spectrometry
  - LOD
  - LOQ
  - calibration
  - quantitation
abstract: >
  loqculate estimates limits of detection and quantitation from
  mass-spectrometry calibration curves. It reads common DIA and targeted
  export formats, fits per-peptide models, and writes LOD, LOQ, and
  optional plots. The default model is a closed-form piecewise fit
  (PiecewiseCF). Bootstrap LOQ is the default; an opt-in delta-method
  path is available for PiecewiseCF.
